  "result": "```json\n{\n    \"smpl.ordering.repositories.QuoteRepository\": {\n        \"summary\": \"Interface for repositories holding quote data. Defines the contract for CRUD operations on Quote entities within the ordering system. Key methods include: `getQuote(String id)` - retrieves a single Quote by its unique identifier; `getQuotesByCustomerName(String customerName)` - retrieves a list of Quotes associated with a specific customer name; `getQuoteIdsByDealerName(String dealerName)` - retrieves a list of quote IDs associated with a specific dealer name; `createQuote(Quote from)` - creates a new Quote from the provided Quote object, throwing a `BadRequestException` if the input is invalid; `updateQuote(String id, Quote quote, String eTag)` - updates an existing Quote identified by `id`, using an eTag for optimistic concurrency control, returning a boolean indicating success; `removeQuote(String id, String eTag)` - deletes a Quote by `id` with eTag-based concurrency control, returning a boolean indicating success. The `@SuppressWarnings` annotation suppresses warnings for same parameter values and unused parameters, suggesting the interface is designed for broader implementations.\",\n        \"file_path\": \"smpl/ordering/repositories/QuoteRepository.java\"\n    }\n}\n```",
